#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:5
msgid "Insert URL link"
msgstr "插入 URL 链接"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works with text as html code. This property allows the user "
"introducing at the `workspace`_ anything that is possible with HTM code. "
"This section explains how the user can create an URL link for a text."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 以文本作为 html 代码进行工作。 此属性允许用户在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中引入 HTM "
"代码中的任何可能内容。 本节解释用户如何为文本创建 URL 链接 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:13
msgid ""
"The URL link is only activated at the PDF version of the document. The link "
"is not activated at the native QElectroTech format."
msgstr "URL链接仅在文档的PDF版本中激活，链接不以原生的QEelectroTech格式激活。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:16
msgid ""
"At the current released version, version 0.7, QElectroTech allows creating "
"an URL link internally or using external html code generators."
msgstr "在目前发布的版本0.7,QElectroTech允许内部创建URL链接或使用外部html代码生成器。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:20
msgid "Insert URL link from QElectroTech text editor"
msgstr "从 QElectroTech 文本编辑器插入 URL 链接"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:22
#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:46
msgid "Display the `text editor`_ by editing the desired `text field`_."
msgstr "通过编辑想要的 `文本字段 <text editor_>`_，显示 `文本编辑器 <text field_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:27
#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:51
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Text editor rich text tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本编辑器丰富文本标签"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:29
msgid ""
"Press the icon **Insert link** from the Menu bar for displaying the Insert "
"link PopUP window."
msgstr "按下菜单栏的图标 **插入链接** 显示插入链接 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:34
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech insert link PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 插入链接 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:36
msgid ""
"Define the text which should be displayed at the `workspace`_ and the "
"desired URL where the link should redirect."
msgstr "定义应当显示在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的文字，以及链接应当重定向的想要的 URL 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:37
msgid ""
"Press the button **OK** to close the Insert link PopUP window and add the "
"link to the text field content."
msgstr "按下按钮 **OK** 关闭插入链接 PopUP 窗口，并将链接添加到文本字段内容中。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:38
#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:61
msgid ""
"Press the button **OK** to save the text field content and close the `text "
"editor`_."
msgstr "按下按钮 **OK** 保存文本字段内容并关闭 `文本编辑器 <text editor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:41
msgid "Insert URL link using external html code generators"
msgstr "使用 html 外部代码生成器插入 URL 链接"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:43
msgid ""
"At the case that something special should be included or any properties "
"should be different, QElectroTech allows creating the html source code using"
" an external code generator and later on introduce the code."
msgstr "在应该包含特殊的东西或者任何属性应该不同的情况下，QEelectroTech允许使用外部代码生成器创建html源代码，后来引入代码。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:53
msgid "Select the source Tab."
msgstr "选择源标签。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:58
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Text editor source tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本编辑器源选项卡"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:60
msgid "Copy the html code from the html code generator."
msgstr "从 html 代码生成器复制 html 代码 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:65
msgid ""
"Many different HTML Table Generator can be found on interned or can be "
"installed at the computer. One internet example is the following:"
msgstr "许多不同的 HTML 表格生成器可以在计算机中找到或安装。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/link_url.rst:68
msgid "https://html-css-js.com/html/generator/"
msgstr "https://html-css-js.com/html/generator/"
